static const char *g_pszMainDocs_OGL_ENABLE_GDI_COMPATIBILITY = "Some applications render GDI on top OpenGL content. There is limited support for this with blit model, but with flip model (can be used by dxPresent path), mixing GDI and other rendering is not supported. In fact the first flip model present to a window permanently disables GDI rendering support for that window. Enabling mixing here prevents the dxPresent path from using flip model when possible (note that diagonal tearing is possible due to bug 200050074). Enabling this is not necessary for applications that use a SUPPORT_GDI pixelformat.";

